''s vice-commander and Mikey''s right hand?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ken ''Draken'' Ryuguji","is_correct":true},{"id":"b","text":"Keisuke Baji","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Takashi Mitsuya","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Kazutora Hanemiya","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Draken, the dragon-tattooed vice-commander who keeps Mikey grounded."},{"id":"q7","question":"Which figure manipulates from the shadows to corrupt Toman?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Shuji Hanma","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Izana Kurokawa","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Tetta Kisaki","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Nobutaka Osanai","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Kisaki climbs Toman and the criminal world itself; Hanma is his muscle, not the mastermind."},{"id":"q8","question":"Which gang does Toman fight first in the story?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Valhalla","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Black Dragon","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Moebius","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Tenjiku","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Moebius — its feud with Pah-chin drags Takemichi into his first real brawl."}]'::jsonb,
